{"page":564,"verses":[{"verse_key":"67:27","surah":67,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا رَأَوْهُ زُلْفَةً سِيٓـَٔتْ وُجُوهُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَقِيلَ هَـٰذَا ٱلَّذِى كُنتُم بِهِۦ تَدَّعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When they see it close at hand, the disbelievers’ faces will be gloomy, and it will be said, ‘This is what you were calling for.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"But when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَأَوْهُ","en_gloss":"they (will) see it","transliteration":"ra-awhu","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"زُلْفَةًۭ","en_gloss":"approaching","transliteration":"zul'fatan","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سِيٓـَٔتْ","en_gloss":"(will be) distressed","transliteration":"sīat","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وُجُوهُ","en_gloss":"(the) faces","transliteration":"wujūhu","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَقِيلَ","en_gloss":"and it will be said","transliteration":"waqīla","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) that which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُنتُم","en_gloss":"you used to","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"for it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَدَّعُونَ","en_gloss":"call","transliteration":"taddaʿūna","verse_key":"67:27"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"67:27"}]},{"verse_key":"67:28","surah":67,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ أَرَءَيْتُمْ إِنْ أَهْلَكَنِىَ ٱللَّهُ وَمَن مَّعِىَ أَوْ رَحِمَنَا فَمَن يُجِيرُ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ مِنْ عَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘Just think- regardless of whether God destroys me a